# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# NOTE, learned the hard way on 2026-09-09: these rules do NOT hide files that
# actually exist. Pages serves a matching static asset before it ever consults
# this file, so committing something to main publishes it regardless of what is
# written here. The only reliable way to keep a file off the live site is to
# keep it out of the deployed branch -- see the `tooling` branch.
#
# These rules therefore only catch paths with no file behind them.

/.github/*    /404.html   404
/.git/*       /404.html   404
